  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even with an advance payment from the video store chain, Kawada's bank book sits just over half of the hundred-million-yen bail target—until Toshi walks in and drops a heavy bag on the desk. Listen for \"sakibarai\", an advance payment.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もう少し時間があれば。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "足りねえだろ。どうすんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これも無理やり先払いしてもらった分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ以上はもう無理だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "上出来じゃねえか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "え？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "五千万入ってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "足したらちょうどだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お前、これどうやって作ったんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "気にすんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "迷ってる暇はねえだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ああ、そうだな。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もう少し時間があれば。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If only we had just a little more time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "足りねえだろ。どうすんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It isn't enough, right? What are you going to do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これも無理やり先払いしてもらった分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even this much is an advance I practically begged him to pay early.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ以上はもう無理だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Any more than this is impossible now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "上出来じゃねえか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, isn't that a pretty great job?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "え？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "五千万入ってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is fifty million yen inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "足したらちょうどだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Put them together and it is right on the mark.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お前、これどうやって作ったんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, how on earth did you put this money together?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "気にすんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't worry about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "迷ってる暇はねえだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We don't have time to hesitate, do we.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ああ、そうだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, you are right.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
